  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safe Eye Care for Women &amp; Girls in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Ethiopia, many barriers particularly prevent women from accessing eye care services. Without targeted efforts to provide eye services for women, gender-based disparities in vision loss will persist. Orbis is committed to bridging this gender blindness gap by prioritising the sight-saving needs of women and girls. With your support, Orbis will provide 900 pairs of glasses to empower women and girls, enabling them to pursue education and work independently, reducing their reliance on others.</narrative>
  </description>
